sequenceDiagram
    participant Tsukuyomi
    participant WT as Worktree
    participant Plan as Plan executor
    participant Eyes

    Tsukuyomi->>WT: git worktree add /tmp/tsuku-sandbox-xyz
    Tsukuyomi->>Plan: execute plan inside worktree
    Note over Plan: ulimit, unshare, HTTP_PROXY=blackhole
    Plan-->>WT: file changes
    Tsukuyomi->>WT: git diff --name-only
    WT-->>Tsukuyomi: actual_files
    Tsukuyomi->>Tsukuyomi: match_score = |actual ∩ expected| / |expected|
    alt match_score >= 0.90
        Tsukuyomi->>Eyes: PASS — proceed to real execution
    else match_score < 0.90
        Tsukuyomi->>Tsukuyomi: REJECT plan; report divergence
    end
    Tsukuyomi->>WT: git worktree remove (cleanup)
